      ],
      "text": "1. Treatment of drug-resistant TB using 6-month",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 19.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        210.4459228515625,
        150.30128479003906,
        235.2409210205078
      ],
      "text": "regimens",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 19.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        246.78114318847656,
        512.57177734375,
        267.6611328125
      ],
      "text": "Recommendation 1.1 The 6-month bedaquiline, pretomanid,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 16.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        265.7811279296875,
        391.37969970703125,
        286.6611328125
      ],
      "text": "linezolid and moxifloxacin (BPaLM) regimen",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 16.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        77.66929626464844,
        298.36651611328125,
        203.97349548339844,
        312.72149658203125
      ],
      "text": "No. Recommendation",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        77.66929626464844,
        319.9811096191406,
        495.4471740722656,
        334.53411865234375
      ],
      "text": "1.1 WHO suggests the use of a 6-month treatment regimen composed of bedaquiline,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        112.86930084228516,
        332.0910949707031,
        504.78070068359375,
        346.53411865234375
      ],
      "text": "pretomanid, linezolid (600 mg) and moxifloxacin (BPaLM) rather than the 9-month or",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        112.86930084228516,
        344.0910949707031,
        356.4852600097656,
        358.53411865234375
      ],
      "text": "longer (18-month) regimens in MDR/RR-TB patients.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        112.86930084228516,
        359.0670166015625,
        389.42132568359375,
        374.73101806640625
      ],
      "text": "(Conditional recommendation, very low certainty of evidence)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        391.4635314941406,
        119.47928619384766,
        407.3155212402344
      ],
      "text": "Remarks",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        414.5234069824219,
        524.5437622070312,
        428.9664306640625
      ],
      "text": "1.\t  Drug susceptibility testing (DST) for fluoroquinolones is strongly encouraged in people with MDR/",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.86609649658203,
        427.7234191894531,
        527.4183349609375,
        442.16644287109375
      ],
      "text": "RR-TB, and although it should not delay initiation of the BPaLM, results of the test should guide",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.86609649658203,
        440.92340087890625,
        527.4317016601562,
        455.3664245605469
      ],
      "text": "the decision on whether moxifloxacin can be retained or should be dropped from the regimen –",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.86609649658203,
        454.1234130859375,
        527.5908203125,
        468.5664367675781
      ],
      "text": "in cases of documented resistance to fluoroquinolones, BPaL without moxifloxacin would be",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.86609649658203,
        467.3233947753906,
        187.41708374023438,
        481.76641845703125
      ],
      "text": "initiated or continued.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        484.775390625,
        298.9967041015625,
        499.2184143066406
      ],
      "text": "2.\t This recommendation applies to the following:",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86609649658203,
        502.227294921875,
        527.541259765625,
        516.6702880859375
      ],
      "text": "a)\t  People with MDR/RR-TB or with MDR/RR-TB and resistance to fluoroquinolones (pre-XDR-TB).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86609649658203,
        519.6793212890625,
        527.4507446289062,
        534.122314453125
      ],
      "text": "b)\t People with confirmed pulmonary TB and all forms of extrapulmonary TB except for TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        532.8792724609375,
        524.4076538085938,
        547.322265625
      ],
      "text": "involving the CNS, osteoarticular or disseminated forms of TB with multiorgan involvement. 21",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86609649658203,
        550.331298828125,
        328.8546447753906,
        564.7742919921875
      ],
      "text": "c)\t Adults and adolescents aged 14 years and older.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86609649658203,
        567.783203125,
        263.020751953125,
        582.2261962890625
      ],
      "text": "d)\t All people regardless of HIV status.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86609649658203,
        585.2352294921875,
        527.4024658203125,
        599.67822265625
      ],
      "text": "e)\t Patients with less than 1-month previous exposure to bedaquiline, linezolid, pretomanid or",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        598.4351806640625,
        527.40576171875,
        612.878173828125
      ],
      "text": "delamanid. When exposure is greater than 1 month, these patients may still receive these",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        611.6351928710938,
        502.966064453125,
        626.0781860351562
      ],
      "text": "regimens if resistance to the specific medicines with such exposure has been ruled out.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        629.0872192382812,
        527.4359130859375,
        643.5302124023438
      ],
      "text": "3.\t This recommendation does not apply to pregnant and breastfeeding women owing to limited",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.86609649658203,
        642.2872314453125,
        267.37139892578125,
        656.730224609375
      ],
      "text": "evidence on the safety of pretomanid. 22",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        659.7391357421875,
        527.368896484375,
        674.18212890625
      ],
      "text": "4.\t The recommended dose of linezolid is 600 mg once daily, both for the BPaLM and the BPaL",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.86609649658203,
        672.9390869140625,
        133.77618408203125,
        687.382080078125
      ],
      "text": "regimen. 23",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        727.1484985351562,
        180.2205047607422,
        740.8524780273438
      ],
      "text": "See subgroup considerations. 21",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        739.5831909179688,
        526.5728759765625,
        753.2871704101562
      ],
      "text": "Data on the use of pretomanid in pregnant women are limited. Animal studies do not indicate direct or indirect harmful effects with  22",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        81.86609649658203,
        752.3832397460938,
        211.1412811279297,
        762.88720703125
      ],
      "text": "respect to embryo-fetal development.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        761.6180419921875,
        464.5126953125,
        775.322021484375
      ],
      "text": "Additional details on linezolid dosing and possible dose reductions are given in the implementation considerations. 23",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        545.8001708984375,
        801.0170288085938,
        554.0401611328125,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "47",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
